      "summary": "Review of the planning-guard compatibility correction found no P0/P1 defects. The guard accepts only the exact 51-task PA/PAI missing-approval negative set, delegates approved/implemented states to raw upstream, and rejects unexpected errors/warnings. One P2 robustness gap: an empty draft programme would be falsely rejected because expected_rejection demands returncode 1 even when no tasks exist. Current scoped tests pass and raw validator behavior is preserved.",
