          "description": "A wholly draft/review_required programme with zero registered slices yields an empty task_ids set. expected_rejection then requires returncode == 1, which the raw validator will not produce for a pass with no missing-approval errors; the guard will therefore fail CI for a valid empty draft programme instead of accepting the raw successful result.",
